  "$comment": "Structure plus tools/receipt_contract.py semantic validation. Only S_OK and a non-reserved mask may have raw/decoded flags. PASS requires three required bits, hardware classification, cleanup, memory/deadline and independent payload binding/retrieval. MIP optional. No proof of rendering. Original receipt retrieval is required; file/GPU calls cannot be cancelled."
